# A project file describes a real network: its address plan, its services, how it is
# segmented. Your own diagrams must never be committed. The synthetic ones that ship
# with the repository live in /examples/ and are not ignored.
# Anchored to the repository root so that a rule never swallows a directory of the
# package itself.
